msgstr "Chain \"%(c)s\" already has another stage marked as %(t)s. Only ONE is allowed — with two reference points there is no telling which to use."

#. module: eam_chain
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:eam_chain.action_eam_chain
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:eam_chain.menu_eam_chain
